# m7_drops (M7 drops, PLAN.md M7 "Formations and drops"): 1942's rule. A crate comes from a
# whole formation shot down (+200 on top of the last kill) or from any beetle killed by a
# bolt; a formation that loses a member (it flies off or rams the ship) drops nothing, and
# kinds outside formations drop nothing (the M6 "every fifth gnat" rule is gone). Input:
# m3_boss's sweep in god mode (debug_god at 31) to 1699, stage 1 (UNIT TESTS).
# Re-pinned for the catch-up clock (the stage clock ran 4 ticks a tick while fewer than 3
# enemies were on the field): crate 1 (a beetle) at 631, crate 2 (the 20 s formation) at 896,
# crate 3 (the second beetle) at 1071, drops 7 by 1700. Re-pinned for the mode paces (NORMAL:
# the table clock hurries, 3 ticks a tick, only on an empty field), every wave after the first
# comes later than under the catch-up:
# - The two opening gnat strings (y 40 at update 151, y 88 at 271) are formations: nine of
#   their ten gnats die (248..369, score 90), one of them by ramming the god-mode ship (a ram
#   kill scores but is lost to its formation), and the tenth flies off (495), so neither is
#   complete: no crate (drops 0 at 500).
# - 451..480: the 7 s wasp vee (no formation) shot down, +90 (score 180): no crate.
# - 685: a beetle shot down (+50): crate 1 (drops 1, pickups 1; 631 under the catch-up).
# - 878..1061: a wasp vee (+30 each), a spider and two moths (+40 each): no crate (drops 1).
# - 1135: the last two gnats of the 20 s string (a formation, all five shot down 1123..1135):
#   +10 +10 +200 (score 580 -> 800) and crate 2.
# - 1195..1214: the 21 s string, not a formation, all five shot down (score 850): no crate.
# - 1328: the second beetle: crate 3 (score 910 -> 960).
# - 1594: the 29 s formation: crate 4 (drops 4 at 1700).
# debug_history_check is 0 with the crates in flight.
--frames 1700 --call-at "31 debug_god" --dump-exports debug_state,debug_drops,debug_score --at "369 debug_score == 90" --at "500 debug_drops == 0" --at "500 debug_score == 180" --at "684 debug_drops == 0" --at "685 debug_drops == 1" --at "685 debug_score == 230" --at "685 debug_pickups == 1" --at "694 debug_history_check == 0" --at "1061 debug_score == 550" --at "1061 debug_drops == 1" --at "1134 debug_drops == 1" --at "1134 debug_score == 580" --at "1135 debug_drops == 2" --at "1135 debug_score == 800" --at "1140 debug_history_check == 0" --at "1214 debug_score == 850" --at "1214 debug_drops == 2" --at "1327 debug_drops == 2" --at "1328 debug_drops == 3" --at "1328 debug_score == 960" --at "1335 debug_history_check == 0" --at "1593 debug_drops == 3" --at "1594 debug_drops == 4" --at "1600 debug_history_check == 0" --expect "debug_state == 1" --expect "debug_drops == 4"
